OL,3,GNEWSARowing club 'on a high' as it
OL,4,Acelebrates 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-founder of a 50-year-old rowing
OL,7,Fclub that has produced Olympic
OL,8,Fchampions said he still got "a buzz"
OL,9,Ffrom seeing others enjoying the sport.
OL,11,FNorthampton Rowing Club has been
OL,12,Fcelebrating its half-century after it
OL,13,Fwas launched in 1976.
OL,15,FIts alumni include Olympic gold
OL,16,Fmedallists Georgie Brayshaw and James
OL,17,FRudkin, while more recently Teagan
OL,18,FSmith was selected for the British
OL,19,Funder-19s team.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
