OL,3,GNEWSARowing club 'on a high' as it
OL,4,Acelebrates 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We now have 120 members of all ages,
OL,7,Fand we do punch well above our weight,"
OL,8,Fsaid 79-year-old Brian Thompson.
